# {{ project_name }}

A Databricks Lakeview dashboard project scaffolded by [dex](https://github.com/yarrib/dex).

## Setup

```bash
uv sync
```

## Deploy

```bash
# Deploy to dev (default target)
databricks bundle deploy

# Deploy to staging
databricks bundle deploy --target staging

# Deploy to prod
databricks bundle deploy --target prod
```

## Development

```bash
# Run tests
uv run pytest

# Lint
uv run ruff check .

# Format
uv run ruff format .
```
